  "goodToKnow": "Die Verschlüsselung is encryption: Ende-zu-Ende-Verschlüsselung, eine sichere Verschlüsselung. Verschlüsseln means to encrypt, and entschlüsseln to decrypt or decode. The German Enigma machine encrypted military messages in WWII until it was broken by Polish and British codebreakers, including Alan Turing at Bletchley Park. Der Schlüssel is a key. Plural: die Verschlüsselungen."
